The 'game-client' folder contains all frontend code for the Shattered Archive game application, serving as the user-facing interface that players interact with directly. It includes the main game client entry point (index.html), status monitoring page (status.html), and all necessary build configurations (package.json, vite.config.ts, tsconfig.json) that make the React-based application functional. This folder represents the client-side portion of the project that handles user experience, game rendering, and communication with backend services.
